    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίπλαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰκος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in double folds</i> or
				<i>layers,</i>
			
