				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.243
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>twofold, double,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεσμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					247.37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
