				Il.
				3.126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.241
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				1.17
			</span></i>: dat. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλάκεσσιν</span> dub.
			l. in <i><span class="en">
